  "title": "VIZSLA SILVER PROVIDES UPDATE ON SITUATION IN CONCORDIA, MEXICO - Vizsla Silver Corp.",
  "summary": "Vancouver, British Columbia (February 9, 2026) – Vizsla Silver Corp. (TSX: VZLA) (NYSE: VZLA) (Frankfurt: 0G3) (“Vizsla” or the “Company”) today reports that it has been informed by a number of families that their relatives, our colleagues, who were taken from the Company’s project site in Concordia, Mexico, have been found deceased. The Company is awaiting confirmation from the Mexican […]",
